OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #2m funding to clear silt
OL,4,Afrom historic docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn additional #2m is to be spent on
OL,7,Fclearing silt from Gloucester Docks,
OL,8,Fafter boats became stranded.
OL,10,FThe Canal & River Trust (CRT) has
OL,11,Fdoubled its dredging budget to #4m in
OL,12,Fresponse to concerns about the impact
OL,13,Fon boaters, businesses and tourism.
OL,15,FThe build-up of silt is being blamed on
OL,16,Fthe prolonged dry weather, low river
OL,17,Fflows and high tides contributing to
OL,18,Fincreased silt being carried into the
OL,19,Fdocks from the River Severn.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
