OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #2m funding to clear silt
OL,4,Afrom historic docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Cottam, CRT regional director, said
OL,7,Fit had caused "significant challenges"
OL,8,Fand it was the charity's job to "get
OL,9,Fthe docks back to a fully operable
OL,10,Fstate".
